	// MedicinesUpdateWithBodyWithResponse Update a medicine
	//
	// Applies a partial update of the allow-listed fields. sku, barcode and
	// brand_id are write-once and cannot be changed. A change to a regulatory
	// flag or to the import provenance requires a reason. Once the medicine is
	// referenced by stock, purchases or sales, the strength, the pack size, the
	// package conversion and the generic reference are protected: the change
	// is refused and a new identity has to be created instead. Requires
	// medicines:update.
