// MedicinesLookupWithBodyWithResponse Exact lookup by barcode or SKU
//
// Resolves exactly one barcode or SKU to a catalogue entry and, when the
// identifier belongs to a variant, to that variant. Exactly one of
// barcode or sku must be provided. A lookup that matches nothing is a
// not-found; a lookup that matches more than one active variant is an
// integrity error (409) and fails closed. The response carries no stock
// and no price. Requires medicines:view.
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
